# React Material-UI Component Usage

## Rule Overview

**CRITICAL:** This project uses Material-UI (MUI) v6 as the UI component library. Never use native HTML elements or components from other UI libraries (like shadcn/ui, Chakra UI, etc.).

## Component Imports

**Always import MUI components from `@mui/material/[ComponentName]`:**

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Import MUI components individually
import Box from '@mui/material/Box';
import Card from '@mui/material/Card';
import CardContent from '@mui/material/CardContent';
import Button from '@mui/material/Button';
import Typography from '@mui/material/Typography';
import Stack from '@mui/material/Stack';
import Table from '@mui/material/Table';
import TableBody from '@mui/material/TableBody';
import TableCell from '@mui/material/TableCell';
import TableHead from '@mui/material/TableHead';
import TableRow from '@mui/material/TableRow';
import Dialog from '@mui/material/Dialog';
import DialogTitle from '@mui/material/DialogTitle';
import DialogContent from '@mui/material/DialogContent';
import DialogActions from '@mui/material/DialogActions';

// ❌ WRONG - Never use native HTML elements for structure
import { div, span, p } from 'react';

// ❌ WRONG - Never use components from other UI libraries
import { Card } from '@/components/ui/card';  // shadcn/ui
import { Button } from '~/components/ui/button';  // shadcn/ui
```

## Component Mapping Reference

Replace native HTML elements with MUI components:

### Layout Components

| Native HTML | MUI Component | Usage |
|-------------|---------------|-------|
| `<div>` | `<Box>` | Generic container |
| `<main>` | `<Box component="main">` | Main content area |
| `<section>` | `<Box component="section">` | Section container |
| `<article>` | `<Box component="article">` | Article container |
| `<header>` | `<Box component="header">` | Header container |
| `<footer>` | `<Box component="footer">` | Footer container |

**Example:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG
<div className="container">
  <div className="card">
    <h1>Title</h1>
  </div>
</div>

// ✅ CORRECT
<Box sx={{ maxWidth: 1200, mx: 'auto' }}>
  <Card>
    <CardContent>
      <Typography variant="h1">Title</Typography>
    </CardContent>
  </Card>
</Box>
```

### Typography Components

| Native HTML | MUI Component | Variant |
|-------------|---------------|---------|
| `<h1>` | `<Typography variant="h1">` | Heading 1 |
| `<h2>` | `<Typography variant="h2">` | Heading 2 |
| `<h3>` | `<Typography variant="h3">` | Heading 3 |
| `<h4>` | `<Typography variant="h4">` | Heading 4 |
| `<h5>` | `<Typography variant="h5">` | Heading 5 |
| `<h6>` | `<Typography variant="h6">` | Heading 6 |
| `<p>` | `<Typography>` or `<Typography variant="body1">` | Paragraph |
| `<span>` | `<Typography component="span">` | Inline text |
| `<label>` | `<Typography component="label">` or use `InputLabel` | Form label |

**Example:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG
<div>
  <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold">Title</h1>
  <p className="text-muted-foreground">Description</p>
</div>

// ✅ CORRECT
<Box>
  <Typography variant="h1">Title</Typography>
  <Typography variant="body2" color="text.secondary">
    Description
  </Typography>
</Box>
```

### Form Components

| Native HTML | MUI Component |
|-------------|---------------|
| `<input type="text">` | `<TextField>` |
| `<input type="email">` | `<TextField type="email">` |
| `<input type="password">` | `<TextField type="password">` |
| `<input type="number">` | `<TextField type="number">` |
| `<input type="checkbox">` | `<Checkbox>` |
| `<input type="radio">` | `<Radio>` with `<RadioGroup>` |
| `<select>` | `<Select>` with `<MenuItem>` |
| `<textarea>` | `<TextField multiline>` |
| `<button>` | `<Button>` |
| `<label>` | `<InputLabel>` or `<FormLabel>` |

**Example:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG
<form className="space-y-4">
  <div>
    <label htmlFor="email">Email</label>
    <input id="email" type="email" />
  </div>
  <button type="submit">Submit</button>
</form>

// ✅ CORRECT
<Box component="form" sx={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
  <TextField
    id="email"
    label="Email"
    type="email"
    fullWidth
  />
  <Button type="submit" variant="contained">
    Submit
  </Button>
</Box>
```

### Table Components

| Native HTML | MUI Component |
|-------------|---------------|
| `<table>` | `<Table>` |
| `<thead>` | `<TableHead>` |
| `<tbody>` | `<TableBody>` |
| `<tr>` | `<TableRow>` |
| `<th>` | `<TableCell>` (in `<TableHead>`) |
| `<td>` | `<TableCell>` |

**Example:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG
<table className="w-full">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Name</th>
      <th>Email</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>John</td>
      <td>john@example.com</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

// ✅ CORRECT
<Table>
  <TableHead>
    <TableRow>
      <TableCell>Name</TableCell>
      <TableCell>Email</TableCell>
    </TableRow>
  </TableHead>
  <TableBody>
    <TableRow>
      <TableCell>John</TableCell>
      <TableCell>john@example.com</TableCell>
    </TableRow>
  </TableBody>
</Table>
```

### List Components

| Native HTML | MUI Component |
|-------------|---------------|
| `<ul>` | `<List>` |
| `<ol>` | `<List>` (styled differently) |
| `<li>` | `<ListItem>` |

### Special Components

**Dialog/Modal:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Using shadcn-style Dialog
import { Dialog, DialogContent, DialogHeader, DialogTitle } from '@/components/ui/dialog';

// ✅ CORRECT - Using MUI Dialog
import Dialog from '@mui/material/Dialog';
import DialogTitle from '@mui/material/DialogTitle';
import DialogContent from '@mui/material/DialogContent';
import DialogActions from '@mui/material/DialogActions';

<Dialog open={open} onClose={handleClose}>
  <DialogTitle>Dialog Title</DialogTitle>
  <DialogContent>
    Dialog content here
  </DialogContent>
  <DialogActions>
    <Button onClick={handleClose}>Cancel</Button>
    <Button onClick={handleSubmit} variant="contained">Submit</Button>
  </DialogActions>
</Dialog>
```

**Card:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Using shadcn-style Card
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle } from '@/components/ui/card';

// ✅ CORRECT - Using MUI Card
import Card from '@mui/material/Card';
import CardContent from '@mui/material/CardContent';
import CardHeader from '@mui/material/CardHeader';

<Card>
  <CardHeader title="Card Title" subheader="Card subtitle" />
  <CardContent>
    Card content here
  </CardContent>
</Card>
```

**Select/Dropdown:**
```tsx
// ❌ WRONG - Using shadcn-style Select
import { Select, SelectContent, SelectItem, SelectTrigger, SelectValue } from '@/components/ui/select';

// ✅ CORRECT - Using MUI Select
import Select from '@mui/material/Select';
import MenuItem from '@mui/material/MenuItem';
import FormControl from '@mui/material/FormControl';
import InputLabel from '@mui/material/InputLabel';

<FormControl fullWidth>
  <InputLabel id="profile-label">Profile</InputLabel>
  <Select
    labelId="profile-label"
    value={value}
    label="Profile"
    onChange={handleChange}
  >
    <MenuItem value="admin">Admin</MenuItem>
    <MenuItem value="user">User</MenuItem>
  </Select>
</FormControl>
```

## Stack vs Flexbox

**Use `<Stack>` for simple flex layouts (MUI convention):**

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD - Use Stack for simple flex layouts
<Stack direction="row" spacing={2} alignItems="center">
  <Button>Cancel</Button>
  <Button variant="contained">Submit</Button>
</Stack>

// ✅ ALSO GOOD - Use Box with sx for complex layouts
<Box sx={{ display: 'flex', gap: 2, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
  <Typography>Title</Typography>
  <Button>Action</Button>
</Box>
```

## Grid System

**Use MUI Grid for responsive layouts:**

```tsx
import Grid from '@mui/material/Grid2';  // Note: Grid2 is the new API

<Grid container spacing={2}>
  <Grid size={{ xs: 12, md: 6 }}>
    <Card>Content 1</Card>
  </Grid>
  <Grid size={{ xs: 12, md: 6 }}>
    <Card>Content 2</Card>
  </Grid>
</Grid>
```

