## Common Mistakes to Avoid

1. ❌ **Never mix native HTML with MUI components**
2. ❌ **Never use components from shadcn/ui or other UI libraries**
3. ❌ **Never use Tailwind CSS classes** (see react-styling-mui.mdc for styling)
4. ❌ **Never create custom wrapper components when MUI provides them**
5. ✅ **Always check `.dump/main-template` for implementation patterns first**
